<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10047" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conductĭo</span></b> ,
		ōnis, f.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A bringing together, uniting</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> In gen. (very rare), <i><span class="en">Cic. Inv.
				1, 40, 74</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">id. ib.</span></i>
			§ 73.— Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Esp., in later medic. writers, <i>a spasm,
				convulsion</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπασμός</span>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">musculorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
					Aur. Acut. 2, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nervorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 18, 177</span></i>
			; 2, 3, 16 al.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A hiring, farming</i> (rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(fundi),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Caecin. 32, 94</span></i>
			:  (vectigalium), <i><span class="en">Liv. 43,
				16, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tota renuntiata est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Verr. 1, 6, 16</span></i>
			 Zumpt (B. and K. condicio).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
